<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Soko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Soko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.12		vs	    3.07</p>
<p> Operating	  105    million    vs	  123    million</p>
<p> Current	    109    million    vs	  125    million</p>
<p> Net		   48    million    vs	   77    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.73 yen	  vs	    4.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  18 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanwa Soko Co Ltd is a warehouse operator.</p>
